Next time we'll talk about the braille on ATMs

339
00:09:14,366 --> 00:09:16,300
一个很多人都用不到的设计
a design that many people never use

340
00:09:16,300 --> 00:09:17,566
为什么还要存在
why does it still exist

341
00:09:17,566 --> 00:09:19,433
因为社会真正高级的地方
because what truly makes a society advanced

342
00:09:19,433 --> 00:09:21,500
不只看它服务多数人多快
isn't just how fast it serves the majority

343
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,633
还看它有没有给少数人留门
